                  "scripts": {},
                  "variableReplacements": [],
                  "variableReplacementStrategy": "originalfirst",
                  "adaptiveMarkingPenalty": 0,
                  "customMarkingAlgorithm": "",
                  "extendBaseMarkingAlgorithm": true,
                  "unitTests": [],
                  "prompt": "<p>ヒント：発電量が多い国と少ない国が、互いに助け合う仕組みを考えましょう。</p>"
                }
              ],
              "scripts": {},
              "variableReplacements": [],
              "variableReplacementStrategy": "originalfirst",
              "adaptiveMarkingPenalty": 0,
              "customMarkingAlgorithm": "",
              "extendBaseMarkingAlgorithm": true,
              "unitTests": [],
              "prompt": "<p>この発電量の変動という弱点を補うために行われている、国境をこえた協力はどれですか。</p>",
              "minMarks": 0,
